        ' The axis target as the Python twin has it: the cylinder's axis point in the world plus (wanted - the pose the part has now), mm to meters.
3658         there(j) = there(j) + (CDbl(wanted(j)) - CDbl(totalValues(9 + j)) * 1000#) * 0.001
    Next j
3660     steps = "axis through (" & NoteList(Array(there(0) * 1000#, there(1) * 1000#, there(2) * 1000#)) & ") mm along (" & NoteList(Array(heading(0), heading(1), heading(2))) & ")"
3661     Set axisFeature = AxisThrough(there(0), there(1), there(2), heading(0), heading(1), heading(2))
    stepLabel = currentIdentity & ": TemporaryMateMove GetCorrespondingEntity"
3663     Set entity = component.GetCorrespondingEntity(face)
3664     Require entity, "The cylindrical face has no counterpart in the top assembly"
3665     aligns = Array(swMateAlignCLOSEST, swMateAlignALIGNED, swMateAlignANTI_ALIGNED)
3666     For j = 0 To 2
