4832     Err.Raise 5, , "MirrorComponents3 made no component in " & IIf(startForm = 0, "any of its forms", "the forms from " & CStr(startForm) & " on") & " (orientation " & CStr(orientation) & ")" & Mid$(summaries, 2)
