    ' that makes no component (an empty answer is not one) is made again in the next form of MirrorCall (mirror-empty-array-nothing, mirror-empty-variant,
    ' mirror-plane-selected, mirror-refplane-object); a mirrored part file that is not on disk is saved from its document (mirror-part-saved).
